{"game": "alien-dawn", "language": "english", "appid": 1376580, "month": "2022-05", "window": 1, "start_date": 1651363200, "end_date": 1654041599, "month_true_total": 4, "quota": 4, "returned": 4, "pulled_at": "2026-09-10 17:08:32 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "116249774", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078147314", "personaname": "IanMarvin", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ianmarvin/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 76, "playtime_forever": 425, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 224, "last_played": 1688854757, "avatar": "af643af1126e5ef70b6044a823e7f8f1eea8ce5a"}, "language": "english", "review": "BUYER BEWARE, THIS GAME IS FUN BUT IS DEFINITELY JANKY\n\nIf this game was 24.99 I would put a thumbs down. but at this price point, if you know what you are getting into, it is a lot of fun.\n\nThe game definitely has some serious asset-store jankiness to it. but the concept is a blast.\n\nA big open map for you and your dudes to explore as you find gear and shoot aliens and monsters, sick.\n\nSo grab some buds, crash that chopper, and go ham trying to find gear, food, and guns while being constantly monitored by a huge overhead spaceship. \n\nAlso final note: Can genuinely get spooky at times. Getting stuck in a cave without a flashlight, then stumbling uipon a secret lab, kinda freaky ngl.", "timestamp_created": 1653930315, "timestamp_updated": 1653930315, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.520335376262664795", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634989869", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 17, "count": 1}, {"reaction_type": 9, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "116199201", "author": {"steamid": "76561198886274915", "personaname": "mikem691", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https:/